  "note": "E5 (#496) retired the DSA Foundations learning path, so its lessons, activities and check questions are no longer native items and audit:native-reviews would reject their records as unknown. Every record whose path was dsa-foundations moved verbatim (JSON round-trip checked) from its batch file into history/review-<batch>-retired.json; batch files left empty were removed, review-2026-10-15-n015.jsonl keeps its one FDE record on its own line. No record was edited, rescored or rebound. The eighteen original DSA readings live on in Learn (lib/learn-lessons/dsa) under their dsa-v1-* ids, and the alg-dsa-* Coding tasks keep their own curation rows; neither is covered by these native records."
